msgid ""
"Tip!\n"
"Press the hidden Yellow button in the main menu to open the RainRadar.\n"
"\n"
"Press the hidden Green button in the main menu to change the hour interval.\n"
"\n"
"Press the hidden Blue button in the main menu to compare two cities.\n"
"\n"
"Press OK here to toggle the temperature overlay: %s"
msgstr ""
"تلميح!\n"
"اضغط على الزر الأصفر المخفي في القائمة الرئيسية لفتح رادار الأمطار.\n"
"\n"
